#: ../../benchmarks.rst:1439
msgid "Sibuna, HAProxy and Envoy"
msgstr "Sibuna, HAProxy und Envoy"

#: ../../benchmarks.rst:1442
msgid ""
"On the same host and with the same build we then ran the three proxies "
"one after another, three times each, with 256 connections for eight "
"seconds in each case. HAProxy was 3.0.11 and Envoy 1.40.2 with BoringSSL. "
"Each proxy had the same eight CPUs and eight threads. Sibuna and HAProxy "
"balanced by least connections, Envoy by least requests. The origins, the "
"load generator and the certificate were the same. The table gives the "
"median of the three runs. The spread between the runs of one case was at "
"most 4%. No request failed."
msgstr ""
"Auf demselben Host und mit demselben Build haben wir dann die drei Proxys "
"nacheinander betrieben, je dreimal, mit 256 Verbindungen und in jedem "
"Fall acht Sekunden lang. HAProxy war 3.0.11 und Envoy 1.40.2 mit "
"BoringSSL. Jeder Proxy hatte dieselben acht CPUs und acht Threads. Sibuna "
"und HAProxy verteilten nach Least Connections, Envoy nach Least Requests. "
"Die Ursprungsserver, der Lastgenerator und das Zertifikat waren "
"dieselben. Die Tabelle nennt den Median der drei Läufe. Die Streuung "
"zwischen den Läufen eines Falls betrug höchstens 4 %. Keine Anfrage "
"schlug fehl."

#: ../../benchmarks.rst:1444
msgid ""
"One host, 256 connections, three proxies: requests per second, the median "
"of three runs, and the resident memory at the end of the run."
msgstr ""
"Ein Host, 256 Verbindungen, drei Proxys: Anfragen pro Sekunde, der Median "
"aus drei Läufen, und der residente Speicher am Ende des Laufs."

